# FINAL_RUN.md must stay current

[`FINAL_RUN.md`](FINAL_RUN.md) is the canonical command sheet for the primary AdaDDAE-PER full run.

## When editing matched files

In the **same** change set, update `FINAL_RUN.md` if any of the following drift:

- Protocol script modes, usage, or order (`adadae_per` smoke → ddae → final → compare → gates)
- Config paths / `run_id` / results directories (`adadae_per`, fair DDAE)
- PER routing files (`adadae_per_exceptions.yaml`, `adadae_per_upgrades.yaml`)
- Shared early-stop / seed / epoch knobs when they affect PER
- Assert / smoke / Vast setup / sync / hardware tier commands
- Artifact paths (`completed.json`, thesis compare/gates)

Also bump the **Last updated** date at the top of `FINAL_RUN.md`.

## Do not

- Leave stale commands after renaming scripts or configs
- Document demoted hybrids (v2–v5.1 multi-track merges) as the primary runnable path without pointing to PER
- Skip updating `FINAL_RUN.md` because “README already mentions it”
